+ * every probes/86 timeline plus the baseline behaviours, through the REAL
+ * Registry and NotifyLoop on a fake clock. The same file runs unchanged in a
+ * 07c3935 tree (main), a 96d3367 tree (held) and the candidate tree, so every
+ * cell of the scorecard comes from the same harness.
