+ * `parseAgentsJson` from what `claude agents --json` prints (status +
+ * waitingFor), so each tree reads exactly what its lister would give it; a
+ * hook the tree does not map (PermissionRequest on main) is skipped, as the
+ * daemon would answer it with nothing.
+ *
+ * Output: one JSON line per case to $D86_OUT (default ./d86.jsonl).
